Z||000003||Brandon86SE||11-07-2001||07:50 PM||||My friend has a 1990 Sunbird GT.  His is a 4cyl turbo.  He's got a brand new turbo on it, and in this condition it's pretty quick actually.  We raced the other night (light to light), and he did fairly well, considering he had 2 more passengers than I did.  I'd guesstimate the 0-60 for it at around 9.5-10s.  I'm too lazy to search the 'net for it though.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  That's just my guess from our racing.<P>Brandon<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Field_Front_(sig)_1.jpg"> ||||reg||10
